{"logId": "7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [837, 135, 1082, 241], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[837.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 241.0], [837.0, 241.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "姐，你来了！ $ ^{注} $妻到三楼报到时听到姐妹们那一声声温馨的话语，那一句句亲切的招呼，刹那间驱走了许多的陌生和距离。\n中秋佳节，妻带着公司发的福利回家。邻居很吃惊：“呀，这么多！”眼光中透着无比羡慕，忽然间，我发现妻笑了，笑得那么坦然！", "block_bbox": [199, 227, 1014, 290], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 227.0], [1014.0, 227.0], [1014.0, 290.0], [199.0, 290.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [198, 299, 975, 360], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 299.0], [975.0, 299.0], [975.0, 360.0], [198.0, 360.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "妻说：“自从我加入胖东来这个大家园后，经历了许多让我感动的事。感谢东来哥给我一次重新工作的机会，工作对我来说是一种无比的快乐与幸福，无比的踏实与成就！滴水之恩，涌泉相报。在以后的日子里我会辛勤地工作。我坚信我的明天会更好！”", "block_bbox": [197, 368, 976, 465], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 368.0], [976.0, 368.0], [976.0, 465.0], [197.0, 465.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "信任", "block_bbox": [239, 519, 429, 573], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 519.0], [429.0, 519.0], [429.0, 573.0], [239.0, 573.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：超市部/涂振营", "block_bbox": [267, 584, 427, 606], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[266.99993896484375, 583.9999389648438], [425.99993896484375, 583.9999389648438], [425.99993896484375, 604.9999389648438], [266.99993896484375, 604.9999389648438]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "这件事使我一直记忆犹新，那是2008年4月26日的中午出去吃饭，刚走到对面中行门口，被一位大姐叫住了：“兄弟帮帮忙吧，把我这袋东西送到对面车上吧。”我看了看她手中的黑色袋子，另一只手并没有其它什么东西，而且这个黑色袋子并不重。心想“这点东西也需要帮忙。”管它呢，即然人家说出来了，就帮人家拎过去得了，谁知道，我刚接过那个袋子没走几步，呼啦一下，袋子破了，好几捆百元大钞滚落在地上，钱！这么多钱！应该有几十万吧，一时间我惊呆了！“诈骗”“假币”“碰瓷”等几个不详", "block_bbox": [197, 635, 660, 975], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 635.0], [660.0, 635.0], [660.0, 975.0], [197.0, 975.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [677, 596, 984, 958], "block_id": 7, "block_order": null, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[677.0, 596.0], [984.0, 596.0], [984.0, 958.0], [677.0, 958.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1002, 606, 1137, 725], "block_id": 8, "block_order": null, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[1002.0, 606.0], [1137.0, 606.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "事后我想了很多，我是胖东来的一员，代表着胖东来的形象，老百姓信赖我是因为信赖我这身工装，信赖胖东来这个品牌，这种信赖不仅仅是要我们用努力工作来回报的，更重要的是一种责任，一种对顾客、对社会的责任。", "block_bbox": [197, 1158, 976, 1256], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 1158.0], [976.0, 1158.0], [976.0, 1256.0], [197.0, 1256.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "的词顿时涌向了我的脑海。大姐好像看出了我的心事，连忙解释道：“兄弟，对不起，事先忘告诉你了，这是我刚从银行取的钱，我一个女人拿着不安全，所以让你帮忙。”听了她的解释我长出了一口气，悬着的心才放了下来，我们急忙蹲下身把钱捡起来，用黑袋包好，向对面停车的地方走去。路上我问道：“大姐，你怎么这么相信我，不怕我把你的钱拿跑吗？”“胖东来人，我信任。”啊！原来是我身上的工装，让她对我产生了信赖。", "block_bbox": [197, 985, 977, 1151], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 985.0], [977.0, 985.0], [977.0, 1151.0], [197.0, 1151.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "想哭就哭吧", "block_bbox": [110, 1407, 296, 1447], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[116.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1446.0], [116.0, 1446.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.6935603022575378, "coordinate": [837, 135, 1082, 241], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[837.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 135.0], [1082.0, 241.0], [837.0, 241.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7932282090187073, "coordinate": [199, 227, 1014, 290], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[199.0, 227.0], [1014.0, 227.0], [1014.0, 290.0], [199.0, 290.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.90584796667099, "coordinate": [198, 299, 975, 360], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 299.0], [975.0, 299.0], [975.0, 360.0], [198.0, 360.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9331253170967102, "coordinate": [197, 368, 976, 465], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 368.0], [976.0, 368.0], [976.0, 465.0], [197.0, 465.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8365533351898193, "coordinate": [239, 519, 429, 573], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 519.0], [429.0, 519.0], [429.0, 573.0], [239.0, 573.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7966551780700684, "coordinate": [267, 584, 427, 606], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[266.99993896484375, 583.9999389648438], [425.99993896484375, 583.9999389648438], [425.99993896484375, 604.9999389648438], [266.99993896484375, 604.9999389648438]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9592560529708862, "coordinate": [197, 635, 660, 975], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 635.0], [660.0, 635.0], [660.0, 975.0], [197.0, 975.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9526587724685669, "coordinate": [677, 596, 984, 958], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[677.0, 596.0], [984.0, 596.0], [984.0, 958.0], [677.0, 958.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.5624464154243469, "coordinate": [1002, 606, 1137, 725], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1002.0, 606.0], [1137.0, 606.0], [1137.0, 725.0], [1002.0, 725.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9420770406723022, "coordinate": [197, 1158, 976, 1256], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 1158.0], [976.0, 1158.0], [976.0, 1256.0], [197.0, 1256.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9561021327972412, "coordinate": [197, 985, 977, 1151], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 985.0], [977.0, 985.0], [977.0, 1151.0], [197.0, 1151.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8294545412063599, "coordinate": [110, 1407, 296, 1447], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[116.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1407.0], [295.0, 1446.0], [116.0, 1446.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "姐，你来了！ $ ^{注} $妻到三楼报到时听到姐妹们那一声声温馨的话语，那一句句亲切的招呼，刹那间驱走了许多的陌生和距离。\n\n中秋佳节，妻带着公司发的福利回家。邻居很吃惊：“呀，这么多！”眼光中透着无比羡慕，忽然间，我发现妻笑了，笑得那么坦然！\n\n\n\n妻说：“自从我加入胖东来这个大家园后，经历了许多让我感动的事。感谢东来哥给我一次重新工作的机会，工作对我来说是一种无比的快乐与幸福，无比的踏实与成就！滴水之恩，涌泉相报。在以后的日子里我会辛勤地工作。我坚信我的明天会更好！”\n\n## 信任\n\n作者：超市部/涂振营\n\n这件事使我一直记忆犹新，那是2008年4月26日的中午出去吃饭，刚走到对面中行门口，被一位大姐叫住了：“兄弟帮帮忙吧，把我这袋东西送到对面车上吧。”我看了看她手中的黑色袋子，另一只手并没有其它什么东西，而且这个黑色袋子并不重。心想“这点东西也需要帮忙。”管它呢，即然人家说出来了，就帮人家拎过去得了，谁知道，我刚接过那个袋子没走几步，呼啦一下，袋子破了，好几捆百元大钞滚落在地上，钱！这么多钱！应该有几十万吧，一时间我惊呆了！“诈骗”“假币”“碰瓷”等几个不详\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_677_596_984_958.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"25%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_606_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n事后我想了很多，我是胖东来的一员，代表着胖东来的形象，老百姓信赖我是因为信赖我这身工装，信赖胖东来这个品牌，这种信赖不仅仅是要我们用努力工作来回报的，更重要的是一种责任，一种对顾客、对社会的责任。\n\n的词顿时涌向了我的脑海。大姐好像看出了我的心事，连忙解释道：“兄弟，对不起，事先忘告诉你了，这是我刚从银行取的钱，我一个女人拿着不安全，所以让你帮忙。”听了她的解释我长出了一口气，悬着的心才放了下来，我们急忙蹲下身把钱捡起来，用黑袋包好，向对面停车的地方走去。路上我问道：“大姐，你怎么这么相信我，不怕我把你的钱拿跑吗？”“胖东来人，我信任。”啊！原来是我身上的工装，让她对我产生了信赖。\n\n## 想哭就哭吧", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_837_135_1082_241.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_837_135_1082_241.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A06%3A43Z%2F-1%2F%2F161df92b484c80eedb04090d1dec47febe5fedbae5a0caeb65c1d8b2ca9999ce", "imgs/img_in_image_box_677_596_984_958.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_677_596_984_958.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A06%3A43Z%2F-1%2F%2Fea0e0eece1cd3e28c699b35fce3f7443e06d84cc6e6135c6fa50b05b32cc0369", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_606_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1002_606_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A06%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2Fd884396bf144c7b7e92a274124e8df07952befa06ab59fe61901c076ef426571"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A06%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2Fc09f3ac179c80ad515a1a0b9ccddc417560b8309dee5263f5a085b1bff7ede34"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A06%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F706bdc585a4216564704da9914aa6afb4c6a958b51c737f193a8ab5a07107768"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7ec621fa-235c-4441-bd9c-6b86921ea165/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A06%3A45Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe5765f96e1ea8a08719981db59dd8cb023456b857bcfa